\f0\fs26 \cf0 Imagine having a private wave pool session with only your friends on a tropical island. No crowds, no drop-ins, no one yelling from the beach.\
\
Hey, you're not even.\
\
Just you and your crew trading perfect waves back to back. Nowadays, most surf spots are either flat, packed, freezing, or somehow all three. But in Hainan, China, it's completely different. You can book a private wave pool session, bring your friends, and choose the waves you want to surf. Barrels, airs, turns, beginner waves. With around twenty wave settings, everyone gets something fun. It's perfect for surf camps, family trips, group getaways, or that dream session with your best friends you've talked about for years. And the best part? After the session, you're not driving three hours back home. You're still on a tropical island. Golf, beaches, food, warm weather, and perfect waves on demand. That's what makes Hainan special.}